Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.04,0:00:01.73,TL,,0,0,0,,擦网为啥喊 {\fs78}let{\fs68}？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.73,0:00:03.62,TL,,0,0,0,,郑钦文也中招
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.87,0:00:06.99,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Let, first serve.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N擦网 一发重发
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.17,0:00:12.47,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Let, first serve.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N擦网 一发重发
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.27,0:00:19.87,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Let, first serve.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N擦网 一发重发
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.17,0:00:20.97,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}That's the hat trick.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N这是第三个了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.47,0:00:24.61,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Let.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N擦网重发
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.32,0:00:28.11,TL,,0,0,0,,连着{\fs78}4{\fs68}个擦网 主裁喊了{\fs78}4{\fs68}次 {\fs78}let{\fs68}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.11,0:00:29.52,TL,,0,0,0,,球明明碰的是网
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.52,0:00:31.20,TL,,0,0,0,,为什么不喊 {\fs78}net{\fs68}？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.92,0:00:33.51,TL,,0,0,0,,答案
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.51,0:00:36.59,TL,,0,0,0,,藏在一个快被忘掉的古英语词里
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.32,0:00:38.83,TL,,0,0,0,,英语里有两个 {\fs78}let{\fs68}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.83,0:00:41.13,TL,,0,0,0,,常用的那个是让 允许
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.13,0:00:43.73,TL,,0,0,0,,网球里这个 来自另一个古英语词
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.73,0:00:46.78,TL,,0,0,0,,意思几乎相反 阻碍 耽搁
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.32,0:00:50.88,TL,,0,0,0,,这个意思 日常口语里早就不用了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.88,0:00:53.58,TL,,0,0,0,,却留在了法律文书和球场上
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.72,0:00:56.47,TL,,0,0,0,,英国护照首页印着 {\fs78}without{\fs68}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.47,0:00:58.75,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}let{\fs68} {\fs78}or{\fs68} {\fs78}hindrance{\fs68} 通行无阻
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.75,0:00:59.52,TL,,0,0,0,,这里的 {\fs78}let{\fs68}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.52,0:01:01.87,TL,,0,0,0,,和 {\fs78}hindrance{\fs68} 一样 是阻碍
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.52,0:01:04.69,TL,,0,0,0,,所以主裁喊 {\fs78}let{\fs68} 宣布的是
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.69,0:01:07.06,TL,,0,0,0,,这一分被阻碍了 不算
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.12,0:01:10.04,TL,,0,0,0,,国际网联的规则写得更宽
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.04,0:01:11.70,TL,,0,0,0,,只要这一分被意外打断
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.70,0:01:14.00,TL,,0,0,0,,就判 {\fs78}let{\fs68} 再打一遍
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.52,0:01:16.75,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}2022{\fs68}年鹿特丹
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.75,0:01:18.81,TL,,0,0,0,,奥热-阿利亚西姆打完这一分
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.81,0:01:21.45,TL,,0,0,0,,以为拿下了赛点 赢下比赛
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.12,0:01:24.35,TL,,0,0,0,,可就在这一分里
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.35,0:01:26.72,TL,,0,0,0,,穆雷的帽子掉在了地上
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.22,0:01:31.08,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}I'm not trying to cheat.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N我不是想耍赖
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.38,0:01:34.04,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}I hit the ball and my hat fell off immediately,{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N我一击球 帽子就掉了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.04,0:01:35.76,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}and I stopped, okay?{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N我就停了 好吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.80,0:01:38.50,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}I promise that's what happened. I'm sorry.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N我保证就是这样 抱歉
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.87,0:01:40.96,TL,,0,0,0,,两人同意 再打
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.17,0:01:44.02,TL,,0,0,0,,巡回赛规则里 帽子掉落 口袋掉球
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.02,0:01:45.94,TL,,0,0,0,,第一次判 {\fs78}let{\fs68} 再犯
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.94,0:01:48.66,TL,,0,0,0,,就算妨碍对手 直接丢分
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.17,0:01:51.55,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}2025{\fs68}年澳网
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.55,0:01:53.04,TL,,0,0,0,,一根羽毛飘进场地
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.04,0:01:55.25,TL,,0,0,0,,兹维列夫捡起来给主裁看
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.25,0:01:57.23,TL,,0,0,0,,球滚进场 纸片被吹进来
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.23,0:01:59.05,TL,,0,0,0,,都算意外干扰
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.17,0:02:01.23,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}10{\fs68}月初中网
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.23,0:02:03.91,TL,,0,0,0,,兹维列夫说发球时广告屏变了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.91,0:02:06.05,TL,,0,0,0,,回看后 判 {\fs78}let{\fs68}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.02,0:02:11.88,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}I mean, this must be one of the most stupid change of rules that I've ever heard in my life.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N这是我听过最蠢的规则改动之一
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.68,0:02:15.88,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}There is no sense if a player sees{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N这说不通 球员要是看到
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.88,0:02:19.76,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}that there is a hindrance of that shot, he stops immediately.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N那一拍受了干扰 会马上停下
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.36,0:02:25.26,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}I mean, we can play a 30-shot rally and he can lose the point,{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N我们打了三十拍 他丢了这一分
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.34,0:02:26.72,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}he's like, OK, I'm going to challenge now.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N然后说 好 我现在要挑战
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.97,0:02:29.47,TL,,0,0,0,,他气的是对手打完几拍 丢了分
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.47,0:02:31.34,TL,,0,0,0,,才申请回看 另外
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.34,0:02:33.40,TL,,0,0,0,,观众喊叫不算干扰
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.07,0:02:36.15,TL,,0,0,0,,最常见的 {\fs78}let{\fs68}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.15,0:02:38.33,TL,,0,0,0,,还是发球擦网 只重发这一发
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.33,0:02:41.05,TL,,0,0,0,,一发还是一发 二发还是二发
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.47,0:02:44.09,TL,,0,0,0,,今年温网{\fs78}1{\fs68}/{\fs78}4{\fs68}决赛
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.09,0:02:45.58,TL,,0,0,0,,大坂直美对穆霍娃
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.58,0:02:47.06,TL,,0,0,0,,又一个擦网 {\fs78}let{\fs68}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.06,0:02:48.92,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}BBC{\fs68} 解说纳芙拉蒂洛娃说
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.92,0:02:50.90,TL,,0,0,0,,取消吧 没用
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.27,0:02:54.35,TL,,0,0,0,,她的理由是 大多数擦网
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.35,0:02:56.35,TL,,0,0,0,,只是轻轻蹭了一下
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.87,0:02:59.53,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}ATP{\fs68} 早就试过
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.53,0:03:00.64,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}2017{\fs68}年起
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.64,0:03:02.82,TL,,0,0,0,,新生代总决赛不再有发球 {\fs78}let{\fs68}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.82,0:03:04.36,TL,,0,0,0,,擦了网也接着打
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.36,0:03:06.11,TL,,0,0,0,,国际网联的规则附录里
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.11,0:03:07.93,TL,,0,0,0,,也留着这种打法
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.37,0:03:13.03,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}2025{\fs68}年澳网表演赛
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.03,0:03:14.40,TL,,0,0,0,,郑钦文搭档德约
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.40,0:03:17.16,TL,,0,0,0,,打快四赛制 发球擦网不重发
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.16,0:03:18.46,TL,,0,0,0,,她这边以为要重发
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.46,0:03:20.95,TL,,0,0,0,,这一分丢了 还被破了发
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.77,0:03:23.60,TL,,0,0,0,,就是这一发
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.58,0:03:26.18,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Oh man, these rules.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N天哪 这规则
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.62,0:03:28.24,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}I had no idea that was going to happen.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N我完全没想到会这样
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.04,0:03:29.86,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}I forgot.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N我忘了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.31,0:03:31.97,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}let{\fs68} 不只网球在用
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.97,0:03:33.33,TL,,0,0,0,,乒乓球发球擦网
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.33,0:03:34.90,TL,,0,0,0,,同样判 {\fs78}let{\fs68}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.25,0:03:40.05,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}You also get yes lets, which is when you get the clearing player,{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N还有 {\fs78}yes{\fs68} {\fs78}let{\fs68} 让位的一方
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.05,0:03:43.71,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}the non-striker, and the striker who's going in to hit the ball,{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N也就是非击球方 和上前击球的一方
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.71,0:03:46.55,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}and they just clash, and no one's really at fault.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N撞在了一起 谁都没错
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.60,0:03:48.73,TL,,0,0,0,,壁球里两人撞上 谁都没错
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.73,0:03:50.03,TL,,0,0,0,,也判 {\fs78}let{\fs68}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.40,0:03:52.48,TL,,0,0,0,,羽毛球也有 {\fs78}let{\fs68}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.48,0:03:54.90,TL,,0,0,0,,可它的发球擦网过去 照打
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.90,0:03:56.93,TL,,0,0,0,,所以 {\fs78}let{\fs68} 不是让 是挡
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.93,0:03:58.62,TL,,0,0,0,,下次听到主裁喊 {\fs78}let{\fs68}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.62,0:04:01.51,TL,,0,0,0,,你就知道 刚才那一下 被挡住了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.51,0:04:02.76,TL,,0,0,0,,要是由你来定规矩
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.76,0:04:05.37,TL,,0,0,0,,发球擦网 还要不要重来？
